[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_HoJQKVFS78sHWoLeLwEIeMLn","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,200p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/connector.md\"","cwd":"/workspace","processId":"85194","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,200p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/connector.md","name":"connector.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/connector.md"}],"aggregatedOutput":"# `<connector />`\n\nA general-purpose connector component for board-to-board, cable, and edge interfaces.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nexport default () => (\n  <board width=\"40mm\" height=\"40mm\">\n    <connector\n      name=\"J1\"\n      manufacturerPartNumber=\"AF_QTZB1_0\"\n      pinLabels={{\n        pin1: [\"VCC\"],\n        pin2: [\"D_NEG\"],\n        pin3: [\"D_POS\"],\n        pin4: [\"GND\"],\n        pin5: [\"EH1\"],\n        pin6: [\"EH2\"],\n      }}\n      footprint={\n        <footprint>\n          <hole pcbX=\"-2.5mm\" pcbY=\"-2.125mm\" diameter=\"1.3mm\" />\n          <hole pcbX=\"2.5mm\" pcbY=\"-2.125mm\" diameter=\"1.3mm\" />\n          <smtpad\n            portHints={[\"pin1\"]}\n            pcbX=\"-3.5mm\"\n            pcbY=\"1.575mm\"\n            width=\"1.1mm\"\n            height=\"3.8mm\"\n            shape=\"rect\"\n          />\n          <smtpad\n            portHints={[\"pin2\"]}\n            pcbX=\"-1mm\"\n            pcbY=\"1.575mm\"\n            width=\"1.1mm\"\n            height=\"3.8mm\"\n            shape=\"rect\"\n          />\n          <smtpad\n            portHints={[\"pin3\"]}\n            pcbX=\"1mm\"\n            pcbY=\"1.575mm\"\n            width=\"1.1mm\"\n            height=\"3.8mm\"\n            shape=\"rect\"\n          />\n          <smtpad\n            portHints={[\"pin4\"]}\n            pcbX=\"3.5mm\"\n            pcbY=\"1.575mm\"\n            width=\"1.1mm\"\n            height=\"3.8mm\"\n            shape=\"rect\"\n          />\n          <smtpad\n            portHints={[\"pin5\"]}\n            pcbX=\"7.15mm\"\n            pcbY=\"-1.475mm\"\n            width=\"1.8mm\"\n            height=\"4mm\"\n            shape=\"rect\"\n          />\n          <smtpad\n            portHints={[\"pin6\"]}\n            pcbX=\"-7.15mm\"\n            pcbY=\"-1.475mm\"\n            width=\"1.8mm\"\n            height=\"4mm\"\n            shape=\"rect\"\n          />\n        </footprint>\n      }\n    />\n  </board>\n)\n```\n\n## USB-C standard example\n\n```tsx\nexport default () => (\n  <board width=\"20mm\" height=\"20mm\">\n    <connector name=\"USBC\" standard=\"usb_c\" pcbX={0} pcbY={0} />\n  </board>\n)\n```\n\n## Accessible orientation warning\n\nPlacement checks can warn when a connector faces away from the nearest board edge:\n\n```text\nJ1 is facing x+ but should face x- so the connector is accessible from the board edge\n```\n\nFor side-entry connectors, place the connector near the board edge it should face, then use `pcbRotation` if needed so the cable or mating part enters from that edge.\n\nFor vertical-entry connectors, such as a battery connector inserted from above, set `insertionDirection=\"from_above\"` on the `<footprint />`. This tells the checker that the connector does not need to face a board edge.\n\n```tsx\n<connector\n  name=\"J1\"\n  pcbX=\"0\"\n  pcbY=\"0\"\n  footprint={\n    <footprint insertionDirection=\"from_above\">\n      {/* pads / holes */}\n    </footprint>\n  }\n/>\n```\n\nOther insertion directions are `from_left`, `from_right`, `from_front`, and `from_back`.\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `standard`, `name`, `footprint`, `connections`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [ConnectorProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#connectorprops-connector)\n- Source: [lib/components/connector.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/connector.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/connector.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/connector.mdx)\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019df7b6-32b2-7820-a5da-1bcbe945e30d","turnId":"019df7b6-32c5-7fb3-9c6b-f139934fa7f9"}}
[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_Ls0PZhhNEe5fWIPkWY9WcBwT","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/chip.md\"","cwd":"/workspace","processId":"97301","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,220p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/chip.md","name":"chip.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/chip.md"}],"aggregatedOutput":"# `<chip />`\n\nUsed to represent virtually any single-part electronic component. Extremely flexible and supports custom footprints and pin arrangements.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nimport type { CommonLayoutProps } from \"tscircuit\"\n\ninterface Props extends CommonLayoutProps {\n  name: string\n}\n\nexport const A555Timer = (props: Props) => {\n  return (\n   <board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">\n    <chip\n      footprint=\"soic8\"\n      pinLabels={{\n        pin1: \"VCC\",\n        pin2: \"DISCH\",\n        pin3: \"THRES\",\n        pin4: \"CTRL\",\n        pin5: \"GND\",\n        pin6: \"TRIG\",\n        pin7: \"OUT\",\n        pin8: \"RESET\"\n      }}\n      {...props}\n    />\n  </board>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `manufacturerPartNumber`, `pinLabels`, `showPinAliases`, `pcbPinLabels`, `schPinArrangement`, `schPortArrangement`, `pinCompatibleVariants`, `schPinStyle`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [ChipProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#chipprops-chip)\n- Source: [lib/components/chip.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/chip.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/chip.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/chip.mdx)\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019df7b6-32b2-7820-a5da-1bcbe945e30d","turnId":"019df7b6-32c5-7fb3-9c6b-f139934fa7f9"}}
