[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"commandExecution","id":"call_9gjyLPVCRVjNSSkn5WjmmbeH","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"sed -n '1,140p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/trace.md && sed -n '1,120p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/net.md\"","cwd":"/workspace","processId":"36775","source":"unifiedExecStartup","status":"completed","commandActions":[{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,140p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/trace.md","name":"trace.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/trace.md"},{"type":"read","command":"sed -n '1,120p' /root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/net.md","name":"net.md","path":"/root/.agents/skills/tscircuit/elements/net.md"}],"aggregatedOutput":"# `<trace />`\n\nThe `<trace />` element represents an electrical connection between two or more points in your circuit. Traces can connect components, nets, or specific pins on components.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nexport default () => (\n  <board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">\n    <resistor name=\"R1\" resistance=\"1k\" footprint=\"0402\" pcbX={-2} schX={-2} />\n    <capacitor name=\"C1\" capacitance=\"100nF\" footprint=\"0402\" pcbX={2} />\n    <trace\n      from=\".R1 > .pin1\"\n      to=\".C1 > .pin1\"\n    />\n  </board>\n)\n```\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `via`, `fromLayer`, `toLayer`, `code`, `message`, `path`, `key`, `thickness`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [TraceProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#traceprops-trace)\n- Source: [lib/components/trace.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/trace.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/trace.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/trace.mdx)\n# `<net />`\n\nThe `<net />` element represents a bunch of traces that are all connected. You should use nets for representing power buses such as \"V5\", \"V3_3\" and \"GND\"\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nexport default () => (\n  <board width=\"10mm\" height=\"10mm\">\n   <group>\n    <capacitor capacitance=\"1uF\" footprint=\"0603\" name=\"C1\" />\n    <net name=\"V5\" />\n    <trace from=\"net.V5\" to=\".C1 .pos\" />\n   </group>\n  </board>\n)\n```\n\n## Props\n\nCommonly used: `name`, `connectsTo`, `highlightColor`, `isPowerNet`, `isGroundNet`, `footprint`, `connections`\n\n## References\n\n- Props: [NetProps](https://github.com/tscircuit/props#netprops-net)\n- Source: [lib/components/net.ts](https://github.com/tscircuit/props/blob/main/lib/components/net.ts)\n- Local docs: [docs/docs/elements/net.mdx](../docs/docs/elements/net.mdx)\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019df7b6-32b2-7820-a5da-1bcbe945e30d","turnId":"019df7b6-32c5-7fb3-9c6b-f139934fa7f9"}}
